{"id":5304,"date":"2025-08-29T14:42:56","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:42:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5304"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:13:57","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:13:57","slug":"cach-lien-ket-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-voi-shopee-pay","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/cach-lien-ket-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-voi-shopee-pay\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi Shopee Pay \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"PpZDdaDTToDKrUxRy4blixwvgPe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bsx3d4LRfoJGlRxVImalY82LgNf\">Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi v\u00ed Shopee l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n TM\u0110T n\u00e0y. Thao t\u00e1c n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y m\u00e0 c\u00f2n m\u1edf ra c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u voucher \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n. \u1ede b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WF6xdXzGUo9ethxdYMzleTGOgGb\">C\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KHvtdXxhloK4PfxH9vSlvM5bgrg\">\u0110\u1ec3 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh di\u1ec5n ra su\u00f4n s\u1ebb, h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZPAdW4D2ociqWxsZKKlEwS6gfh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 x\u00e1c minh th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J8hFdQRXHoblXVxZ6rjlIr1pg3c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u00ed ShopeePay c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C5BKdEARjoysD3xmhUKl0ykMgCb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Internet Banking\/SMS Banking \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn m\u00e3 x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c OTP.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XP0SdSvPUoQzrixZjarlHRWJgQe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Quan tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong> H\u1ecd t\u00ean v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 CMND\/CCCD \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u00ean Shopee ph\u1ea3i <strong>tr\u00f9ng kh\u1edbp tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i<\/strong> v\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u1ea1i ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AXcPdvLN7oFs4lxP6Cyl8IXSgsh\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi ShopeePay<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ij5GdZPSbooOOwxa1TLlLi5Lgbc\">Quy tr\u00ecnh li\u00ean k\u1ebft r\u1ea5t tr\u1ef1c quan v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i ph\u00fat ngay tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-H3vFdK1wJotWdFxhbiLl02pIgld\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee v\u00e0 truy c\u1eadp ShopeePay<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div