\/08\/60544347-245e-4327-a213-a927d2e91166.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60544347-245e-4327-a213-a927d2e91166-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60544347-245e-4327-a213-a927d2e91166-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60544347-245e-4327-a213-a927d2e91166-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60544347-245e-4327-a213-a927d2e91166-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5305\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee v\u00e0 truy c\u1eadp ShopeePay<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PpZDdaDTToDKrUxRy4blixwvgPe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CrvwdXmFHoTjQ3xq599lbCXdgUb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea1i trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee, t\u00ecm v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c &#8220;<strong>T\u00f4i<\/strong>&#8221; \u1edf g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q1oCdZ84yo7lt4xeItdlFtf3g7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong ph\u1ea7n Ti\u1ec7n \u00edch c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i, ch\u1ecdn &#8220;<strong>V\u00ed ShopeePay<\/strong>&#8220;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div data-page-id=\"PpZDdaDTToDKrUxRy4blixwvgPe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QUW7dS0oIo8GGGxtlublW6lKgJd\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i&#8221;<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-VPWVdtKEEo28VYx2BUhl2BtLgMN\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b52af40b-6715-49e8-811a-a8106b71fd40&quo