\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f65202a3-0af9-4186-88e3-9c1a2d9add0c-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f65202a3-0af9-4186-88e3-9c1a2d9add0c-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f65202a3-0af9-4186-88e3-9c1a2d9add0c-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5306\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i&#8221;<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PpZDdaDTToDKrUxRy4blixwvgPe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UZo6dRzppoUmp4xLvKylDVuqg1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea1i giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a v\u00ed ShopeePay, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng <strong>C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t<\/strong> (h\u00ecnh b\u00e1nh r\u0103ng c\u01b0a) \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i. H\u00e3y nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DkUadY8isofUXZxJMMKlTMItgI6\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ti\u1ebfp theo, ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c &#8220;<strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i<\/strong>&#8220;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B74Odgbsyo0IKPxHIL4l0sEbg8g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong giao di\u1ec7n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn &#8220;<strong>Th\u00eam t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng li\u00ean k\u1ebft<\/strong>&#8220;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ELhnd56tAofjw9xVJIOlaXkLg8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1ed9t danh s\u00e1ch c\u00e1c ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 s\u1ebd hi\u1ec7n ra. H\u00e3y l\u01b0\u1edbt v\u00e0 <strong>ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang logo ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/strong> m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111ang s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Qoy7d5U7Mo0qD6x07All3Ty8gEg\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MC9Dd5fIMoSjc2xrwrRlXSHLgle\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8f21c73b-2a86-4870-a9ee-b1ab96c5760c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTjlHbMYP6oSSEYxDkjblOUQvgCf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TjlHbMYP6oSSEYxDkjblOUQvgCf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:156896,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8f21c73b-2a86-4870-a9ee-b1ab96c5760c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTjlHbMYP6oSSEYxDkjblOUQvgCf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TjlHbMYP6oSSEYxDkjblOUQvgCf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:156896,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5307\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5307\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5307\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/78c8b10f-559f-42e5-8ce4-9769b50b06e6.png\" alt=\"Nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/78c8b10f-559f-42e5-8ce4-9769b50b06e6.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/78c8b10f-559f-42e5-8ce4-9769b50b06e6-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/78c8b10f-559f-42e5-8ce4-9769b50b06e6-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/78c8b10f-559f-42e5-8ce4-9769b50b06e6-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/78c8b10f-559f-42e5-8ce4-9769b50b06e6-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5307\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PpZDdaDTToDKrUxRy4blixwvgPe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E4rudjvfSoGMC4xeG9clRJ8jgsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin:<\/strong> T\u00f9y v\u00e0o ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n nh\u1eadp <strong>S\u1ed1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c <strong>S\u1ed1 th\u1ebb ATM<\/strong>. H\u00e3y \u0111i\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2KVdzK15oWt0kxWIujltl5Pgmg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>X\u00e1c minh:<\/strong> Sau khi nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn b\u01b0\u1edbc x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c. Ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t <strong>m\u00e3 OTP (One-Time Password)<\/strong> qua tin nh\u1eafn SMS \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SOsIdxVJboDbCKx4TMGlDJWigbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1eadp m\u00e3 OTP n\u00e0y v\u00e0o \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh li\u00ean k\u1ebft. Khi m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t!<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-YjV8dQTPxoVO3uxRhqSlXmjdglY\">C\u00e1c l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng khi li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JxMIdoVjOo19wLxqy6blJUwngbb\">\u0110\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh g\u1eb7p l\u1ed7i kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n, h\u00e3y ghi nh\u1edb nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K9Gzd5t2ooiuq7xk4HmlSdCogab\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ef9 th\u00f4ng tin:<\/strong> Sai m\u1ed9t con s\u1ed1 trong s\u1ed1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\/s\u1ed1 th\u1ebb c\u0169ng s\u1ebd khi\u1ebfn giao d\u1ecbch th\u1ea5t b\u1ea1i. H\u00e3y lu\u00f4n ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng tin tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi nh\u1ea5n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z6R6dxr1GoJD5oxA0oulexhyg2d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c:<\/strong> S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i b\u1ea1n d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Shopee <strong>ph\u1ea3i tr\u00f9ng kh\u1edbp<\/strong> v\u1edbi s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u1eadn OTP t\u1ea1i ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QiumdSmoJokpL1xfPzilKEYtgRd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Lo\u1ea1i th\u1ebb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3:<\/strong> ShopeePay ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi <strong>th\u1ebb ATM n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba (th\u1ebb ghi n\u1ee3)<\/strong>. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 th\u1ebb tr\u1ea3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc (prepaid) ho\u1eb7c th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 \u0111\u1ec3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OeqldPFM8oVSNVxT1OelX4kpgVf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u1ea3o m\u1eadt tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i:<\/strong> <strong>Kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd<\/strong> chia s\u1ebb m\u00e3 OTP, m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u ShopeePay hay th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng cho b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ai, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1ef1 x\u01b0ng l\u00e0 nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean Shopee.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-RxWddhzUVoEmnZxOqsalb90xgOe\">Gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ed0hdNUE3oJNtuxFOXAlPISUgEb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ea1i sao t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng li\u00ean k\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DUdOdIvoqojKAXxcDsRlrov7gwc\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 do th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n (H\u1ecd t\u00ean, CMND\/CCCD) gi\u1eefa Shopee v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng tr\u00f9ng kh\u1edbp, ho\u1eb7c s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd kh\u00f4ng gi\u1ed1ng nhau. H\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vv9Sdd1e3orP1QxVh9Mlnvi9gkc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft bao nhi\u00eau t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi ShopeePay?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ej0od8VtdoZBwhxZErWlOQcNgZc\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng kh\u00e1c nhau v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t v\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 linh ho\u1ea1t trong vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZn7dAxJZocjaAxWPd7ly4A1gZb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u00ed li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u00e0 n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng l\u00e0 bao nhi\u00eau?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PHRVdi22Uoqgtmx6Wlklx3vwgge\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0o v\u00ed ShopeePay l\u00e0 <strong>ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"4\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bnq7ds30DoC4taxUITWl9I7Tgyh\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MocydT72wod6skxn7FMlONMggVh\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n v\u00e0o l\u1ea1i m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i&#8221;, ch\u1ecdn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n mu\u1ed1n h\u1ee7y v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn &#8220;H\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JJQqd8254oa0cKxxXCrlmyiRgJe\">Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft ShopeePay gi\u00fap t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, vi\u1ec7c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh kinh doanh c\u0169ng quan tr\u1ecdng kh\u00f4ng k\u00e9m. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n tr\u00ean s\u00e0n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p t\u1ea1i <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CAOTd6Y9OolRjlx7ksPlDGNjgRc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MXvLdhq5DoAWS2xr0milEUCngiM\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4K5dquArozvjZxZBimlFdvrgEe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFZCd3tyaoby8ex5p1Tl1Z2CgOc\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ot27dBXUgozLBGxZQ9tlxfoPgTc\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jdpyd431xo6z27xVYpvlkGJUgiH\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fflmd9LvxovjfwxjlC3lJYTagee\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vi\u1ec7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi v\u00ed Shopee l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n TM\u0110T n\u00e0y. Thao t\u00e1c n\u00e0y kh\